/T (As I grew older, I realized our 4:15 chai ritual was not unique to my family. Around the world, people cling to small routines that bring comfort to their ever-changing lives. Whether it is an evening walk, a brief conversation with next-door neighbors, or a cup of chai shared between strangers at a street food stall, these rituals often carry a meaning far deeper than the act itself. )
